style=3D'mso-bookmark:sec1_1'><span lang=3DEN-US> Problem</span></span></h2>

</div>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US>Gener=
al
Practitioner consultations are conducted under significant time pressure.
Within a short consultation window, doctors must simultaneously listen to
patient concerns, ask relevant clinical questions, identify symptoms and red
flags, perform or document clinical examinations, decide on management plan=
s,
and record accurate clinical notes.</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US>This =
creates a
set of recurring operational challenges that have direct implications for
clinical quality and patient safety:</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
3.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Time spent documenting after the consultation ends, reducing t=
he
number of patients that can be seen</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
3.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Inconsistent or incomplete clinical notes that vary in quality
between practitioners</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
3.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Missing clinical information required for accurate diagnosis a=
nd
safe management</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
3.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Red flags or escalation triggers being overlooked due to
consultation workload</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
3.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>&#8226;<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
 </span></span></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Increased administrative burden that reduces overall consultat=
ion
efficiency and doctor wellbeing</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US><o:p>=
&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<div style=3D'mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #=
2E75B6 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #2E75B6 .75pt;padding:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm'>

<h2 style=3D'border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #2E75B6 .75pt;padding:=
0cm;
mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm'><a name=3D"sec1_2"></a><span class=3DGra=
mE><span
style=3D'mso-bookmark:sec1_2'><span lang=3DEN-US>1.2<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Proposed</span></span></span><span
style=3D'mso-bookmark:sec1_2'><span lang=3DEN-US> MVP</span></span></h2>

</div>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US>To ad=
dress
these challenges, this project proposes a web-based AI Clinical Assistant t=
hat
helps doctors document consultations more efficiently. The MVP will demonst=
rate
an end-to-end workflow using simulated consultation data only.</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US>The M=
VP will
allow a doctor to perform the following actions within a single integrated
workflow:</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
4.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>1.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Upload or simulate a doctor&#8211;patient consultation convers=
ation</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
4.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>2.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Automatically generate a structured clinical note from the
transcript</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
4.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>3.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Identify missing clinical information that should be clarified=
 with
the patient</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
4.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>4.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Detect predefined red flags and escalation triggers</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
4.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>5.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Display basic clinical suggestions with cited medical referenc=
es</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
4.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>6.<span
style=3D'font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></sp=
an></span><![endif]><span
lang=3DEN-US>Review, edit, and approve the generated output before saving</=
span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US><o:p>=
&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US>The c=
linical
scope of the MVP is intentionally narrow, covering adult GP consultations
involving acute cough, sore throat, runny nose, nasal congestion, fever, and
upper respiratory symptoms. This focused scope allows the team to demonstra=
te
end-to-end functionality while keeping clinical risk, data complexity, and
development effort manageable within the MVP timeframe.</span></p>

<div style=3D'mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #=
2E75B6 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #2E75B6 .75pt;padding:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm'>

<h2 style=3D'border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #2E75B6 .75pt;padding:=
0cm;
mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm'><a name=3D"sec1_3"></a><span class=3DGra=
mE><span
style=3D'mso-bookmark:sec1_3'><span lang=3DEN-US>1.3<span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>Guardrails</span></span></span><sp=
an
style=3D'mso-bookmark:sec1_3'></span></h2>

</div>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US>The M=
VP is not
intended to diagnose patients, generate prescriptions, or replace clinical
judgement. It functions as a documentation and decision-support tool only. =
The
following guardrails apply throughout the system:</span></p>

<p class=3DMsoListParagraph style=3D'margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin=
-bottom:
3.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2'><![if=
 !supportLists]><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:Arial'><span style=3D'mso-lis=
t:Ignore'>&#8226;<span
