<h1 style=3D'background:#1F4E79'><a name=3Dsec8><span lang=3DEN-US>8. How P=
atient
Data Will Be Prevented from Being Exposed to the LLM</span></a></h1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:6.0pt'><span lang=3DEN-US>Becau=
se <span
class=3DSpellE>OpenRouter</span> routes requests to third-party model provi=
ders,
every outbound LLM call must be treated as leaving the team's trust boundar=
y. A
mandatory de-identification layer runs inside the <span class=3DSpellE>Supa=
base</span>
Edge Function before any text reaches <span class=3DSpellE>OpenRouter</span=
>.
This is a blocking step &#8212; if high-risk identifiers cannot be masked, =
the
call is aborted.</span></p>

